# Telegram MTProto API Credentials (REQUIRED)
# Get api_id + api_hash from https://my.telegram.org/apps
# (reusing credentials from one of your own projects there is fine).
#
# On Cloudflare Pages: set these in
#   Workers & Pages → your project → Settings → Environment variables
# for BOTH Production and Preview, then redeploy (values are baked in at build time).
# There is NO in-app manual entry — without these, login cannot proceed.
# Wrong or mismatched values surface as Telegram 400 API_ID_INVALID.
VITE_TELEGRAM_API_ID=
VITE_TELEGRAM_API_HASH=
